            <p class="ind-hero-sub">The NIS2 Directive obliges thousands of EU organizations to cybersecurity measures. Article 21 requires risk management, incident handling, and effectiveness testing. VORNAC proves what attackers can actually reach. Audit-ready for NIS2.</p>
